-    *   $\text{MLP}_{in}$: Standard Euclidean coordinates $(x, y, z)$ and viewing direction $\mathbf{d}$.
-    *   $\text{MLP}_{out}$: Re-parameterized coordinates $(x_0, y_0, z_0, 1/r)$ and viewing direction $\mathbf{d}$.
